  <AltText>
    Artfight attack of our headmate, Vihreääketty (or 'Vihre' for short), from magicscanvas. Vihre is a teal-blue kitsune with pink hair, big ears, and pink eyes. They are wearing a bright green dress. They also have a decent size pair of breasts, the cleavage of which can be seen from the dress' v-cut. They also have light blue paw pads. There are two poses for them shown. The one on the left is them winking at the viewer while holding up their left paw. The right pose shows them giving the viewer the side-eye smile, where one eyes is seen whilst a smirk is visible from the mouth.
  </AltText>
